      "message": "A lot of the logic is about checking whether this is a pattern filter or an address filter, and currently it\u0027s done by checking whether the handle maps to a None or some address.\n\nHow about never insert the pattern handle to `monitor_handle_map` instead? This way we can check:\nif `monitor_handle \u003d\u003d handle` --\u003e pattern filter\nelse if `monitor_handle_map.contains_key(handle)` --\u003e address filter\nelse --\u003e bad handle\n\nHopefully that can simplify a lot of the logic? e.g. if it\u0027s an address filter, we skip the check whether it\u0027s already added to the handle_map.",
